From 2a9d213b303e34e6b073b2e41eb6ac110b97e25a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cizar-szymon <szymon@cs-lab.eu>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:05:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 0.122: LAN game - Quit asks to save (the Save box, then the
 end), no LAN_ERR save of a game ended on purpose on either side, names PLAYER
 1 and PLAYER 2 at first

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01J7U35RuKvTQMs84jNJEFhT
---
 src/lan-box.cc  |  4 +--
 src/lan-box.h   |  4 +--
 src/lan-game.cc | 18 ++++++++---
 src/lan-game.h  | 12 +++++++-
 src/popup.cc    | 79 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 src/popup.h     |  5 ++++
 6 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/lan-box.cc b/src/lan-box.cc
index 7cfde1e..1d9bfaf 100644
--- a/src/lan-box.cc
+++ b/src/lan-box.cc
@@ -245,8 +245,8 @@ LanBox::LanBox(Interface *_interface, PGameInfo _mission)
